OL,3,GNEWSATributes pour in as Boxout Fest's
OL,4,Afounder dies
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He made sure Birmingham had a strong
OL,7,Fcommunity of young people who were
OL,8,Fcharitable, helpful and knew how to
OL,9,Fhave a good ole time," said friends as
OL,10,Ftributes poured in for the founder of
OL,11,FBoxout Fest.
OL,13,FEhi Oboite, known as DJ Buxley, was the
OL,14,Fmastermind behind the event which
OL,15,Fattracted thousands of people to the
OL,16,Fcity and provided a platform for the
OL,17,Fcelebration of black music and culture.
OL,19,FHe died on Saturday at the age of 34
OL,20,Fafter privately suffering for four
OL,21,Fyears from cancer.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
